flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Collect water-point report]
    B --> C{Required fields valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Display errors]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Calculate people points]
    E --> F[Calculate safety-risk points]
    F --> G[Calculate downtime points]
    G --> H[Calculate safe-alternative points]
    H --> I[Add score components]
    I --> J{Classify score}
    J -->|75-100| K[Critical: refer immediately]
    J -->|55-74| L[High: refer within 48 hours]
    J -->|30-54| M[Medium: schedule within 7 days]
    J -->|0-29| N[Low: monitor/routine maintenance]
    K --> O[Rank safe, available alternatives]
    L --> O
    M --> O
    N --> O
    O --> P[Create referral summary]
    P --> Q[Save report as NEW]
    Q --> R{Enter another report?}
    R -- Yes --> B
    R -- No --> S([End])
